  "body_html": "<h1>Multiple-Parameter Transfer Layer</h1>\n<p>In a multiple-parameter mechanism, each agent reports a valuation function over\nthe allocation space. This is the abstract transfer-mechanism layer used by\nVCG-style constructions.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:md_multiple_parameter_interface] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
